 mind-headless -- bench --ticks 100000\n33: \n34: # Engine\n35: tools/build.sh                 # mind-gdext + mind-headless -> client/bin/rust, syncs scenarios\n36: godot4 --path client           # opens res://scenes/game.tscn\n37: \n38: # Server (local publish wipes dev data; --check is the bindings drift gate)\n39: server/build.sh\n40: server/build.sh --check\n41: spacetime describe mindustry --server local\n42: \n43: # Gates\n44: tools/ci.sh                    # full local gate (fmt/clippy/tests/goldens/bench/godot/STDB)\n45: tools/mcp-smoke.sh             # in-engine MCP smoke (needs the editor running)\n46: ```\n47: \n48: In-engine workflows (launch, node map, pid-stamped\n49: evals) are in [`.opencode/skills/playtest/SKILL.md`](.opencode/skills/playtest/SKILL.md);\n50: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs the Rust/STDB/Godot-import jobs on push/PR to `main`.\n51: \n52: ## License\n53: \n54: GPL-3.0 (derivative of Mindustry). See `LICENSE` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.\n\n(End of file - total 54 lines)\n</content>",
